OpenVDN vdn-minimax-h3 (https://huggingface.co/OpenVDN/vdn-minimax-h3)

The video DiT's window-softmax attention and linear branch
(runtime/metal/kernels/video/dit/window_attention.metal and
linear_branch.metal, runtime/video/ops/WindowTable.mm) and its converter
(install/video/convert_dit.py) implement VDN-H3's hybrid attention from
