FastVideo (https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo)

The TAEH3 preview decoder (runtime/metal/kernels/video/preview,
runtime/video/h3/ops/PreviewDecoder.mm, install/video/convert_preview.py)
follows FastVideo's TAEH3 port (fastvideo/mlx_runtime/minimax_h3_taeh3.py).
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
